new_head "Summoner Guild"
new_text "Please note, I talk a LOT of shit."
tmp_head "Welcome, Summoners of Holy Mission.(Redsexy, Mar 16, 140)****"
tmp_text "Some of you aren't old enough to remember the Summoner Guild.Some of you may well remember the chaos we caused.Its time now to cast off old allegiances and pledge your loyalty here.The legend of the Summoner is a vast and intricate one.  Beforeyou can join you have to pass a series of tests.  This is so thatonly the most elite players can join our number.  We are anelitist guild.  We never tell our secrets to the outside world,and we are not particularly loyal to one another either.  Weinvest our energies into the creatures we create.Its deliberatly hard to find our guild.  New players should bevetted carefully before being invited to the guild, and in most cases newplayers will not be admitted until a formal introduction to the GuildMaster is made.  Of course, there will be the occaisonal new playerwho manages to find their way here all by themselves.  They shouldbe treated with suspicion until you have maintained their worthiness.Summoner will rule the MUD once more!Redsexy****"
msg_num 1
